<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <title>Roadmap & Changelog | PsiloConValley</title>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    {{template "nav-styles" .}}
     {{template "base-styles" .}}
      <style>
        .wrap {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 60px 20px 80px;
        }

        .wrap .label {
            font-size: 10px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #39ff8a;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .wrap h1 {
            font-size: clamp(28px, 5vw, 48px);
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: -1.5px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .wrap .sub {
            font-size: 15px;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
            line-height: 1.7;
            max-width: 580px;
            margin-bottom: 56px;
        }

        .wrap .card {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 28px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            transform: none;
        }
        .wrap .card:hover {
            transform: none;
        }

        .wrap .card-top {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .wrap .card h2 {
            font-size: 17px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: -0.3px;
        }

        .wrap .badge {
            font-size: 10px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            padding: 4px 10px;
            border-radius: 20px;
        }

        .badge-live    { background: rgba(57,255,138,0.12); color: #39ff8a; border: 1px solid rgba(57,255,138,0.25); }
        .badge-soon    { background: rgba(96,165,250,0.12); color: #60a5fa; border: 1px solid rgba(96,165,250,0.25); }
        .badge-planned { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); }
	        /* ── Tags ── */
        .wrap .tag {
            display: inline-block;
            font-size: 10px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            padding: 4px 10px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .tag-shipped {
            background: rgba(57,255,138,0.12);
            color: #39ff8a;
            border: 1px solid rgba(57,255,138,0.25);
        }

        .tag-building {
            background: rgba(251,191,36,0.12);
            color: #fbbf24;
            border: 1px solid rgba(251,191,36,0.25);
        }

        .tag-planned {
            background: rgba(96,165,250,0.12);
            color: #60a5fa;
            border: 1px solid rgba(96,165,250,0.25);
        }

        /* ── Meta ── */
        .wrap .meta {
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.25);
            margin-top: 12px;
            font-family: monospace;
        }

        .wrap .card p {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
            line-height: 1.65;
        }

        .wrap .section-head {
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 2.5px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.25);
            margin: 40px 0 16px;
        }

        .wrap .thesis {
            margin-top: 56px;
            padding: 32px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
            border-radius: 14px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
        }

        .wrap .thesis h2 {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 14px;
            letter-spacing: -0.3px;
        }

        .wrap .thesis p {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
            line-height: 1.75;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .wrap .card { padding: 20px; }
            .wrap .card h2 { font-size: 16px; }
        }
    </style> 
    </head>
<body>

{{template "nav" .}}

<div class="wrap">
    <div class="label">The Network · Live</div>
    <h1>Roadmap & Changelog</h1>
    <div class="sub">
        Everything we've built, what we're building now, and where the network is growing next.
        <strong>This is a living document. Updated with every release.</strong>
    </div>

    {{/* ── Recently Shipped ── */}}
    <div class="section-head">Recently Shipped</div>

    <div class="card">
        <div class="tag tag-shipped">Shipped · June 2026</div>
        <h2>Bilingual Interface — English & Spanish</h2>
        <p>
            Full interface translation toggle. Dashboard, navigation, and labels
            render in English or Spanish based on user preference.
            <strong>Built for the 41 million Spanish speakers in America who run businesses.</strong>
        </p>
        <div class="meta">v3.8 · Language saved to user profile</div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <div class="tag tag-shipped">Shipped · June 2026</div>
        <h2>Command Center Dashboard</h2>
        <p>
            Redesigned dashboard with "Needs Attention" section — shows overdue invoices
            and pending estimates at a glance. No more digging through tables to find what matters.
        </p>
        <div class="meta">v3.8 · Action-first design</div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <div class="tag tag-shipped">Shipped · May 2026</div>
        <h2>Estimates with Client Approval Flow</h2>
        <p>
            Full estimate creation, client response flow (Accept / Decline / Suggest Changes),
            and one-click conversion from accepted estimate to draft invoice.
            <strong>The complete quote-to-cash pipeline.</strong>
        </p>
        <div class="meta">v3.5 · Public client response route · No login required</div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <div class="tag tag-shipped">Shipped · May 2026</div>
        <h2>Stripe Connect — Client Card Payments</h2>
        <p>
            Business owners connect their Stripe account and clients pay invoices
            directly by card. Money goes straight to the business owner.
        </p>
        <div class="meta">v3.3 · OAuth flow · Direct payouts</div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <div class="tag tag-shipped">Shipped · May 2026</div>
        <h2>Recurring Invoice Automation</h2>
        <p>
            Set up recurring schedules — weekly, monthly, or custom intervals.
            The system generates and optionally emails invoices automatically.
            <strong>Set it once. Get paid forever.</strong>
        </p>
        <div class="meta">v3.1 · Background scheduler engine</div>
    </div>

    {{/* ── In Progress ── */}}
    <div class="section-head">Building Now</div>

    <div class="card">
        <div class="tag tag-building">In Progress</div>
        <h2>Smart Dashboard Actions</h2>
        <p>
            The dashboard will tell you exactly what to do next — "Smith Family approved
            the quote, send the invoice" or "Pool World is 3 days late, send a reminder."
            <strong>Your business brain, automated.</strong>
        </p>
        <div class="meta">Target: v3.9</div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <div class="tag tag-building">In Progress</div>
        <h2>Additional Languages</h2>
        <p>
            Hindi, Punjabi, Mandarin, Cantonese, and Vietnamese translations
            are in development. The engine is built — we are expanding the vocabulary.
        </p>
        <div class="meta">Target: v4.0</div>
    </div>

    {{/* ── Planned ── */}}
    <div class="section-head">On The Horizon</div>

    <div class="card">
        <div class="tag tag-planned">Planned</div>
        <h2>Borderless Payment Instructions</h2>
        <p>
            Better defaults for international invoicing — Wise, ACH, SWIFT instructions
            with multi-currency presentation and clearer payment terms on PDFs.
        </p>
        <div class="meta">Discovery phase</div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <div class="tag tag-planned">Planned</div>
        <h2>Estimate Expiry Dates</h2>
        <p>
            Set a validity period on estimates. After expiry, the client sees
            "This estimate has expired" and must request a new one.
        </p>
        <div class="meta">Design phase</div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <div class="tag tag-planned">Planned</div>
        <h2>Stablecoin Payment References</h2>
        <p>
            Manual crypto payment instructions on invoices — wallet address,
            memo/reference, and optional tx hash confirmation. No custody. No wallets.
            Just instructions.
        </p>
        <div class="meta">Research phase</div>
    </div>

    {{/* ── Origin ── */}}
    <div class="origin">
        <h2>Why "PsiloConValley"?</h2>
        <p>
            Mycelium is the underground network of fungal threads that connects trees,
            moves nutrients across a forest, and enables life above the surface.
            It does invisible work that makes everything else possible.
        </p>
        <p>
            <strong>That is exactly what blue collar business owners do.</strong>
            They are the underground network of the American economy.
            The name is not an accident. It is the thesis.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<footer>
    <p>
        Built with Go + PostgreSQL —
        <a href="/research">Research</a> ·
        <a href="/tools">Tools</a> ·
        <a href="/security">Security</a>
    </p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
